sequenceDiagram
  actor C as Client
  participant UI as React UI
  participant AG as Agent (Qwen3-8B)
  participant MCP as MCP Tools
  participant API as Express API
  participant SC as LocalBank
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  actor A as LB Admin

  rect rgb(242, 244, 247)
  note over C,A: Human-to-human chat
  C->>UI: send message
  UI->>API: POST /chat
  API->>DB: insert CHAT_MESSAGE
  API->>A: notify
  A-->>API: reply
  API-->>C: message delivered
  end

  rect rgb(234, 241, 251)
  note over C,DB: AI chatbot (Phase III, confirmation-gated)
  C->>AG: ask question / request action
  AG->>MCP: read tool (balance, loan status)
  MCP->>API: query
  API->>DB: SELECT
  AG-->>C: answer + proposed action
  C->>AG: confirm (human gate)
  AG->>MCP: write tool (submit_loan_application)
  MCP->>SC: tx (EIP-7702 session key)
  AG->>DB: append AGENT_ACTION_LOG
  AG-->>C: confirmation + tx hash
  end
